{"4614410": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Lonely Planet", "steam_appid": 4614410, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lonely Planet is a story based Boomer Shooter presented in a Cel Shaded, Stylized art style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >with over 30+ guns you can get while playing through the main story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the overworld, clear dungeons, fight boss battles and save the planet!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore &amp; Collect Weapons!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4614410/extras/509f6fa095d511cc9cff22ecedf6018a.avif?t=1781343065\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a vast overworld, and find various <strong>dungeons</strong> with secrets inside and a menacing foe waiting at the end!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fight Bosses!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4614410/extras/5a7f41a1d246eca4a31f032e3754586d.avif?t=1781343065\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world invaded by dangerous creatures, you will have to fight many bosses all posing a different challenge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear a dungeon? There's probably a boss at the end...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Save the planet!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4614410/extras/418d5414ae23ce375d13bbb01d0fdb90.avif?t=1781343065\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have crashed on a planet invaded by harmful creatures. You must help the harmless creatures and protect them from the massive beasts!</p>", 